1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,712
How to Apologize Sincerely.

2
00:00:02,662 --> 00:00:13,075
A good apology has four elements: specific acknowledgment of what was done wrong, genuine regret, an offer to make amends, and an explanation of how reoccurrence will be prevented.

3
00:00:13,075 --> 00:00:16,837
I am sorry you feel that way” deflects responsibility.

4
00:00:16,837 --> 00:00:20,325
Excuses and justifications should be avoided.

5
00:00:20,325 --> 00:00:24,875
Sincere apologies restore trust and can strengthen relationships.

6
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:30,200
Research shows that people who apologize are perceived as more competent, not less.

7
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,587
Admitting fault takes courage and earns respect.

